  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAPSEAH Safeguarding and Accountability Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund with the aim of promoting a safer and more accountable aid system through,
1. SEAH trends and PSEAH progress is measured and analysed enabling evidence informed prevention and response. 		
2. Organisations are better able to prevent and respond SEAH with innovative solutions that meet evidence informed needs.		
3. Global public goods support accountability, prevention and response across the sector</narrative>
  </description>
